# ngemper.ai

- Stack: Astro 5 static, TypeScript strict, vanilla CSS, vanilla TS island, Vitest. No React/Tailwind/map SDKs.
- Money: IDR only. Badges: estimate / approx / flight avg.
- Maps: Google Maps Embed iframe only. Placeholder if PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_EMBED_KEY missing.
- Data: curated static JSON. No scraping, booking, live transport APIs, or pathfinding graphs.
- Honesty: footer "Estimates · curated Aug 2026 · not for booking".
- Domain logic lives in src/lib/* (no DOM). TDD with Vitest before UI for totals/rank/compose.
